# detail
Number of changes: 1

1. Modified | Method implementation
   Changed the implementation of `concat` from constructing and returning a new collection object to issuing a deprecation warning and returning `self.flatten()`.
   The original implementation included:

   * Assignment statement: assign a value to `name`;
   * Assignment statement: assign a value to `dsk`;
   * Return statement: return `type(self)(merge(self.dask, dsk), name, self.npartitions)`.

   The new implementation includes:

   * Call statement: call `warn("Deprecated.  Use the .flatten method instead")`;
   * Return statement: return `self.flatten()`.
# /detail
